OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cuts to BBC Two trade test
OL,7,Ftransmissions in January 1975 were
OL,8,Fmotivated in part by the need to save
OL,9,Fenergy.
OL,11,FThe impact on the public was minimal
OL,12,Falthough the trade suffered
OL,13,Finconvenience.
OL,15,FBut a year earlier, a national
OL,16,Femergency led to much more serious cuts
OL,17,Fto broadcasting.
OL,19,FFrom 17th December 1973 until early
OL,20,FFebruary 1974, all three channels had
OL,21,Fto close down by 10.30pm.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
