SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1784184974
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn practice, the closedown times were
OL,7,Fstaggered to avoid the risk of a power
OL,8,Fsurge.
OL,10,FThe BBC's networks closed at 10.20pm
OL,11,Fsome nights ` ITV curtailed News at Ten
OL,12,Fon the others.
OL,14,FThe early closedown caused broadcasters
OL,15,Fnightmares.
OL,17,FLate evening programmes either had to
OL,18,Fbe abandoned completely or rescheduled
OL,19,Fin earlier slots.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1784184974
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome BBC programmes which were due to
OL,7,Fbe shown at 9.25pm, such as certain
OL,8,Feditions of Play for Today, had to be
OL,9,Fdropped as they would not be finished
OL,10,Fby 10.30pm.
OL,12,FThe loss of late evening advertising
OL,13,Fwas a blow to ITV.
OL,15,FThe row over the early closedowns was
OL,16,Fexplored in an article in The Stage `
OL,17,Fthe newspaper of the entertainment
OL,18,Findustry ` in January 1974.
OL,20,FThe power saving directly involved
OL,21,Fseemed modest.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
