SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1784184974
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FDid the cut have more to do with
OL,7,Fsending the nation to bed early `
OL,8,Fturning off lights and fires as well as
OL,9,Ftelevision sets?
OL,11,FThe obvious point was made: why not go
OL,12,Ffor a daytime shutdown instead?
OL,14,FIn fact, BBC Two made a big energy
OL,15,Fsaving before the corporation was
OL,16,Fordered to save power.
OL,18,FBBC Two transmitters were kept shut all
OL,19,Fday when possible. The morning showing
OL,20,Fof Play School was moved to BBC One.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13305
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1784184974
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis almost certainly saved far more
OL,7,Fpower directly than the early
OL,8,Fclosedowns.
OL,10,FMeanwhile ` despite the need to save
OL,11,Ffuel ` BBC One was free to show the
OL,12,Ftest card all morning as usual during
OL,13,Fthe school holidays.
OL,15,FIt would be interesting to know if
OL,16,Fconsideration was given to an enforced
OL,17,Fdaytime closedown.
OL,19,FNothing before lunchtime and from 2pm `
OL,20,F4pm?
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
