OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCBBC makes power saving by
OL,4,Ckeeping BBC Two off air during daytime
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther services deemed essential to
OL,7,Fnational life were exempted from the
OL,8,Fmajor power restrictions and the Three
OL,9,FDay Week.
OL,11,FThese included newspapers and radio
OL,12,Fbroadcasters.
OL,14,FYet even in 1973, some did not seem to
OL,15,Fconsider television essential in the
OL,16,Fsame way.
OL,18,FApparently Prime Minister Ted Heath did
OL,19,Fnot have a set.
OL,23,APub: 20-Jan-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
